sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant ML as ML Model
    participant DB as Storage

    Note over User,DB: 1. Upload X-Ray
    User->>UI: Select Image
    UI->>API: Upload File
    API->>DB: Save Image
    DB-->>API: Filename
    API-->>UI: Upload Success
    
    Note over User,DB: 2. Get Prediction
    UI->>API: Request Prediction
    API->>DB: Load & Preprocess
    DB-->>API: Image Data
    API->>ML: Run Inference
    ML->>ML: CNN + Attention<br/>+ Classification
    ML-->>API: Probabilities
    API->>ML: Generate Grad-CAM
    ML-->>API: Heatmap
    API-->>UI: Results + Heatmap
    UI-->>User: Display Results
    
    Note over User,DB: 3. Generate Report
    User->>UI: Download Report
    UI->>API: Request PDF
    API->>DB: Load Image
    API->>API: Create PDF
    API->>DB: Save PDF
    API-->>UI: PDF File
    UI-->>User: Download PDF
